@Cinema.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5169

### Hold a seat: 200 when accepted (also when the same customer repeats it)
POST {{Cinema.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sessions/S1/seats/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seatId": "A1",
  "customerId": "Bob"
}

### Another customer on the same seat: 409 while Bob's hold is active
POST {{Cinema.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sessions/S1/seats/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seatId": "A1",
  "customerId": "Jessica"
}
